---
// A collapsible "Methodology" section under a project's chart, styled like the
// earlier "View data as a table" toggle: the browser's own disclosure triangle
// and small gray text. Built on <details>/<summary>, so it works with the
// keyboard and screen readers without any script.
---

<details class="text-sm">
  <summary class="cursor-pointer text-ink/60 hover:text-ink">Methodology</summary>
  <div class="mt-2 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
    <slot />
  </div>
</details>
